WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.850
Start a new empty ChatGPT chat. (3× speed)

00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:01.183
Choose the workshop book from the computer. (3× speed)

00:00:01.183 --> 00:00:01.687
The workshop book is attached. (3× speed)

00:00:01.687 --> 00:00:07.537
Write the request using the attached book. (3× speed)

00:00:07.537 --> 00:00:07.697
Send the book and the request. (3× speed)

00:00:07.697 --> 00:00:09.697
Read the complete sent prompt.

00:00:09.697 --> 00:00:12.771
ChatGPT generates the interactive activity. (4× speed)

00:00:12.771 --> 00:00:13.839
Complete the foundation level and inspect an incorrect answer.

00:00:13.839 --> 00:00:21.296
Focus the answer field

00:00:21.296 --> 00:00:26.049
Check answers

00:00:26.049 --> 00:00:35.337
Reveal answers

00:00:35.337 --> 00:00:38.630
Focus the answer field

00:00:38.630 --> 00:00:44.253
Check answers

00:00:44.253 --> 00:00:53.384
Next

00:00:53.384 --> 00:00:53.518
Explain why prompt context does not demonstrate retraining.

00:00:53.518 --> 00:01:00.738
Focus the answer field

00:01:00.738 --> 00:01:11.565
Check answers

00:01:11.565 --> 00:01:17.275
Reveal answers

00:01:17.275 --> 00:01:19.100
Hide answers

00:01:19.100 --> 00:01:28.257
Next

00:01:28.257 --> 00:01:29.408
Classify fine-tuning, a prompt definition, and retrieved context.

00:01:29.408 --> 00:01:31.562
Parameters change

00:01:31.562 --> 00:01:34.495
Prompt context changes

00:01:34.495 --> 00:01:37.735
Retrieved context changes

00:01:37.735 --> 00:01:43.823
Check answers

00:01:43.823 --> 00:01:48.040
Reveal answers

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:49.767
Hide answers

00:01:49.767 --> 00:01:50.639
Revisit the foundation answers, then reset that level.

00:01:50.639 --> 00:01:54.731
Revisit the foundation level

00:01:54.731 --> 00:02:00.450
Reset level
